package gpu 1
# ============================================================
# in.main
# Full MD Workflow for Nanofluid EOR under Body Force
# ============================================================

# ------------------- 1. Units & Atom Style ------------------
units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p f

bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic

# ------------------- 2. Simulation Box ----------------------
region          sim_box block 0 80 0 160 0 90 units box
create_box      15 sim_box     bond/types 1     angle/types 1     extra/bond/per/atom 11     extra/angle/per/atom 10     extra/special/per/atom 12
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (80 160 90)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid

read_data       oil_drop.data add append offset 0 0 0 0 0 shift -60 -220 -135
Reading data file ...
WARNING: Non-zero image flags with growing box can produce bad coordinates (src/read_data.cpp:675)
  orthogonal box = (-60 -220 -135) to (140 380 225)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  1200 atoms
  scanning bonds ...
  1 = max bonds/atom
  orthogonal box = (-60 -220 -135) to (140 380 225)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading bonds ...
  1100 bonds
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
